Download, verify and install the newest version (a tarball installed by you only; Zaun must be closed and no game running)

Usage: zaun update apply [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -v, --verbose...  Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
  -h, --help        Print help
